	(descr "Seeed XIAO nRF52840 (Sense), through-hole header mounting only (castellated SMD pads removed). 1.0mm holes. USB end at +X; IMU axes (LSM6DS3TR-C: +X away from USB, Z out of component side, Y by right-hand rule) drawn on silkscreen; silkscreen stops at X=9.3 so it stays on-board when the USB end overhangs the board edge.")
